  "reviews": [
    {
      "game": "Crimson Desert Enhanced",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/8400/450x258/crimson-desert-enhanced-pc-mac-steam-cover.jpg?v=1793631600",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/8400-buy-crimson-desert-enhanced-pc-mac-steam/",
      "user": "damy_080",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Honestly this is probably the best game ive played in years, the amount of details, exploration its amazing. Game basicly also has mechanics for growing your own farm, house building, tree cutting, trading which are all unnececery for main story progression but add soo much content when u want to do any of them. The amount of unique characters, regions, pets, mounts is also crazy. Combat is also amazing, it gives u loads of different ways to take down enemies. People that say controls are bad probably played too little of the game to understand them, on controller at least all controls are very well designed, for kbm i cant say since i didnt play on it. This game is in my opinion this years GOTY and 10/10."
    },
    {
      "game": "Mouthwashing",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/17938/450x258/mouthwashing-pc-game-steam-cover.jpg?v=1793631600",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/17938-buy-mouthwashing-pc-game-steam/",
      "user": "shigemura",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/5950931-1658508410.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Mousewashing is a very good game with an excellent story, you may not be interested first for the graphism but you have to give it a try. The game is very short (2h to finish) Not hard and the gameplay is simple and doesn't try anything. The game is here to tell you a horror story and it's on point, but not scary tho."
    },
    {
      "game": "Rain World",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/7716/450x258/rain-world-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1793631600",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/7716-buy-rain-world-pc-steam/",
      "user": "gamer-2e6d6e8",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "This is a very fun game, but also very challenging. You are absically dropped into an actual ecosystem, where you have to survive. Unlike in most games where you are the only thing that can be killed by other things, in this game something big can be eaten by something even bigger or by something small but in large groups. The fandom is very nice and they also have a wikipedia, which i recomend that you read. It also has a great story, nice lore and the steam workshop has even more slugcats, campaigns or even whole new worlds. Fun, challenging and very complex."
    },
    {
      "game": "Gears of War: E-Day",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/9572/450x258/gears-of-war-e-day-pc-xbox-series-x-s-microsoft-store-cover.jpg?v=1793631600",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/9572-buy-gears-of-war-e-day-pc-xbox-series-x-s-microsoft-store/",
      "user": "gamer-a874dc7",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Ive always been a long time fan of the gears franchise. This one feels like it gets back to the core gameplay mechanics of the original 3. Everyone freaking out over strong female characters or \"woke\" crap need to chill. Its a game...stop making everything political or politically correct."
    }
